# ResiRoo E2E testing (`y-tst-e2e-resiroo`)

Use this rule for **all** ResiRoo end-to-end manual test runs. It replaces the archived runbooks in **`cursor_back/rules/`** (`mp-e2e-testing.mdc`, `rr-e2e-test.mdc`).

**Entry point:** When starting from **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e.mdc`**, answer Q0 with **Resiroo** first, then follow this rule. When Resiroo is already clear, invoke this rule **directly** (skip Q0).

Final report format: `.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/insight/y-ins-e2e-report.mdc`.

---

## Mandatory pre-flight (AskQuestion only)

**Do not start any E2E step until all applicable questions are answered.** Use the **AskQuestion** tool for each; never substitute free-text guesses.

| Step | ID | When | Prompt | Options |
|------|-----|------|--------|---------|
| Q1 | `e2e_env` | Always | Test environment | `Local` · `MP (Testing)` |
| Q2 | `e2e_data_mode` | Always | Data source | `Live MP APIs` · `Mock (local mp_mock)` |
| Q3 | `e2e_ingress` | **`Local` only** | Resident message ingress | `RabbitMQ` · `Chat API` |
| Q4 | `e2e_seed_source` | Mock only | How to prepare seed data | `Generate realistic seed` · `Fetch once from MP-Testing` |
| Q5 | `e2e_client_id` | Fetch only | Client id for fetch | `Use CLIENT_ID from .env.e2e.local` · `Enter specific client id` |
| Q6 | `e2e_image_count` | Test case uses or may use resident photos | How many test images to generate? | `0 (no images)` · `1` · `2` · `3` · `Use existing images only (no generation)` |

**Image generation (Q6 and sub-rules):** Do **not** call **GenerateImage** until Q6 is answered (when applicable). **`0`** is valid. Generated images must be **realistic, relevant** to the work order / test case, and **normal quality** — no over-engineered generation pipelines. Upload via **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-upload-photo.mdc`**; scenario text via **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/resiroo/y-maintenance-work-order.mdc**.

**Branching after Q1–Q2:**

| Env | Data mode | Path |
|-----|-----------|------|
| Local | Live MP APIs | WO setup via sub-rules (if needed) → ingress (Q3) → verify Postgres |
| Local | Mock | `make mp-mock-e2e-up` → ingress (Q3) → verify Postgres |
| MP (Testing) | Live MP APIs | WO + ForceResiroo + SMTP resident email (ingress = SMTP; skip Q3) |
| MP (Testing) | Mock | **Blocked** — ask user to choose `Local` + Mock or Live MP APIs |

